Original commit body from bd1d772:

Changed the "How Representative Is This Sketch?" table to compare against
4x and 16x token budgets instead of just 2x. This provides more useful
insight into how coverage improves with larger budgets.

With 2x, large files often still don't fit, so the table would show
minimal improvement. With 4x/16x, users can see the trajectory - at what
budget do the important files start fitting?

Example for a 4,000 token budget:
- 4,000t → 16,000t (4x) → 64,000t (16x)

This helps users decide if they should increase their token budget.
